# Claude Code sandbox /dev/null bind-mount artifacts — character device nodes
# bind-mounted over host shell/tool/editor config inside every worktree. Not
# repo content and not committable (git cannot stage a character device); listed
# here only to keep `git status` clean. Caveat: .gitmodules, .mcp.json, and
# .claude/commands are names this repo could legitimately track in the future —
# a real file at one of those paths needs a one-time `git add -f`.
/.bash_profile
/.bashrc
/.profile
/.zprofile
/.zshrc
/.gitconfig
/.ripgreprc
/.gitmodules
/.mcp.json
/.claude/commands
/.idea
/.vscode
